  "details": "It would be incredibly helpful to be able to change hotkeys for different actions in VRChat. I'm kind of surprised it doesn't have that already. It would be awesome be able to change the existing keybinds to other buttons. \n\nAdditionally the ability to set hotkeys for different avatar gestures or emotes would be SO good. Maybe in the radial menu you could set it per Avatar, that way instead of browsing the clunky radial menu for something I can just hit a key I set to activate a specific action.\n\nThanks for taking the time to look at my suggestion :3",
